        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. Salaries paid for supplemental activities are set forth in Appendix B and Appendix J which are incorporated into, and hereby made a part of this Contract. All salary increases shall be effective beginning July 1, 1987.",
            "block_bbox": [
                53,
