        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "D. Summer session employment shall be paid at the teacher's daily rate of pay in effect during the contractual period immediately preceding the summer session. Variations to the normal five (5) day work week shall be as set forth in Appendix I which is incorporated into, and hereby made a part of this Contract. Supplemental salary shall not be included in calculating the daily rate of pay.",
            "block_bbox": [
